Z||000006||stsmithgt||04-17-2001||01:37 PM||||I just went to a Pick n Pull in Sacramento and found an 87 GT and 5 other coupes in fair condition for being in a yard.  I removed a lot of parts that I didn't need, but left them there for someone else to get without damaging other parts to get them.  I wish I could have fit the hood in/on my car off the GT.  It's better than mine.  I figure since I had the time and tools I would help out the boneheads who come in without tools and rip parts out.  I've seen more wire harnesses cut up for no reason.  The plug was right there! Unplug the damn thing!<BR>     Hey! nice wrecking yard venting thread. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
